# Ownership for the studio line. Standard: docs/DOCS_STANDARD.md.
#
# Each rule lists exactly two owners: primary first, backup second.
# GitHub requests review from both. The last matching rule wins.
# repolint (codeowners, doc-owner) fails a rule for a missing path, a rule
# without a backup, and a document header that names different owners.

# Default: kernel, Studio shell, tooling, standing instructions.
*                                         @esengine @SivanCola

